# mise

Applies at the repo root when `.config/mise/config.toml` is present.

- **Format / verify:** `mise run fix` from the repo root. Fix runs linters and autofix via hk—**do not** run `mise run check` during local/agent work. CI uses `mise run check` in GitHub Actions only.
- **Tests / build:** `mise run test`, `mise run build` — prefer these over raw `go test` / `go build` unless the user specifies otherwise.
- **Discover commands:** `mise tasks` — prefer `mise run <task>` over ad-hoc shell unless the user specifies otherwise.
- **Setup:** `mise run init` once after clone (installs tools, optional hk hook, `init-ci`).
- **New automation:** add bash tasks under `.config/mise/tasks/` or entries in `.config/mise/config.toml`, unless the user specifies otherwise.
